  - 'Not built yet. Here will be Brannoch''s bough on the Massive Sword''s Way, the weapon tree: taking Earth from its god opens it and gives Brannoch''s Standing Stone. Neither the weapon nor its moves are made yet. Brannoch is not built yet either. The Way arrives in phase 5 of the playtest.'
